### Opret film som USER (skal give 403)
POST http://localhost:7070/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "title": "Test med token",
  "releaseDate": "2020-01-01",
  "tmdbRating": 7.5,
  "tmdbId": 999
}

###
// ===== GENRES =====
GET http://localhost:7070/api/genres

###
GET http://localhost:7070/api/genres/1

###
GET http://localhost:7070/api/genres/abc

### RATING: giv film 1 en rating (skal give 200)
// ===== RATING OG ANBEFALING (kræver USER) =====
POST http://localhost:7070/api/movies/28/rating
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "rating": 9,
  "comment": "Rigtig god film"
}

### RATING: ændr din rating på samme film (skal give 200 og samme id som før)
POST http://localhost:7070/api/movies/28/rating
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "rating": 7,
  "comment": "Lidt mindre god anden gang"
}

### RATING: ugyldig værdi (skal give 400)
POST http://localhost:7070/api/movies/1/rating
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "rating": 11
}

### RATING: film findes ikke (skal give 404)
POST http://localhost:7070/api/movies/99999/rating
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "rating": 5
}

### RATING: uden token (burde give 401)
POST http://localhost:7070/api/movies/1/rating
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5
}

### users anbefalinger (burde give 200)
GET http://localhost:7070/api/recommendations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SERVER: register
// ===== DEPLOYED SERVER =====
POST https://exam.datudvikling.dk/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "seif",
  "password": "test1234"
}

### SERVER: login (gemmer token)
POST https://exam.datudvikling.dk/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "seif",
  "password": "test1234"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("serverToken", response.body.token);
%}
